{
  "$schema": "./SCHEMA.md#domain-tags",
  "description": "The registry of structured-signing-bytes domain tags (avalon_protocol::signing_bytes::tags), one per signed kind. A tag is ASCII [a-z0-9._], appears in the message with no length prefix, is never reused for another kind and no tag is a prefix of another. The conformance tag is reserved for vectors and never signed in production. A runner asserts its own registry holds exactly these tags (kind is the constant name, lowercased).",
